<title>SPAIN: Spain Oct currency reserves rose $1.46 bln.</title>
<headline>Spain Oct currency reserves rose $1.46 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     OCT 96     SEPT 96     OCT 95</p>
<p> Rise/fall in month	1,462.4     1,276.4	 58.5</p>
<p> End-month total	  57,862.3    56,399.9   37,701.0</p>
